section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span>春华秋实，逐梦桂子山！</span></p><p><span>华中师范大学伍伦贡联合研究院热忱欢迎全国各高校优秀应届本科毕业生，通过推荐免试方式报考我院2027级全日制硕士研究生，与我们一同求知求索，深耕前沿领域！</span></p></section></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/x7icLic6UZiaxAYRof5SkCM8bl9PRYoxCf9icnviamYQrtWxiaOE11kvrH5tkmQrCAxvPYJZeZNYMX7HweJxbTK15ic74sYK4xIzrzt2ShgW7BdcT8/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>预报名时间</span></strong></p></section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span><span>2026 年 9 月 3 日 8:00—9 月 11 日 18:00</span></span></strong></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><b><span>01</span></b></p></section></section><section><section><p><b><span>学院简介</span></b></p></section></section></section><section><section><p><span><strong><span>华中师范大学伍伦贡联合研究院</span></strong></span><span>（英文名：Central China Normal University Wollongong Joint Institute，以下简称“联合研究院”）是由</span><strong><span><span>华中师范大学</span></span></strong><span>和</span><strong><span><span>澳大利亚沃隆港大学</span></span></strong><span>（原伍伦贡大学，英文名：University of Wollongong）联合创立并经教育部正式批准的中外合作办学机构（教外函〔2016〕17号）。</span></p><p><span>学院设有</span><span><strong><span>计算机技术（科学）、通信工程、软件工程、人工智能（机器学习与大数据）</span></strong></span><span>专业的双学位（获中方学历、学位及外方学位）和申请-考核制（获外方学位）的硕士研究生项目。</span></p><p><span>作为华中师范大学首个获批的中外合作办学机构，联合研究院建院10年来，融合两校优质教育资源，通过引进沃隆港大学信息技术领域优质的国际课程体系、质量监控和学术标准，依托国家数字化学习工程技术研究中心、教育大数据应用技术国家工程研究中心等国家级科研平台，在人才培养、科学研究和国际交流合作等方面取得了累累硕果，面向国家重大战略需求的重点领域培育了近千名研究生层次具有国际化视野的应用型、创新型人才。</span></p></section></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/x7icLic6UZiaxBtbKpau8PUU1eZvt2ibiawtbpn1obR90aGRodnkKib3Seia75Xl5StU6UvaIGiacGg1t4hO0mjwvsSaMiaWicleZmibqaCQzxYn6SevZM/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><section><section></section></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/x7icLic6UZiaxD1ceHkZjzIm4r9HK5LE1g9uv2Xmy3Tulibg3kS6PyzsjI2pUQJzjD5lgEfNC4nb5f26IPbV2PHmUZHJ7bicT4PolIZpaprb6SyM/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><section><p><b><span>02</span></b></p></section></section><section><section><p><b><span>申请条件</span></b></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>01</span></strong></p></section></section><section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span>中华人民共和国公民，拥护中国共产党的领导，品德良好，遵纪守法；</span></p></section></section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/x7icLic6UZiaxCibDjdFUlia8tJ6N1Mbe1TwIpRON5tqyTNfglMPIJNmUd4x46PFqHnMF1vic3dmQibTzwKs0IjmEx4IqJiaxPCvbhUxk659nEJGChE/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>02</span></strong></p></section></section><section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span>预计可获得本科就读学校推免资格，推免资格最终以教育部推免服务系统审核结果为准；</span></p></section></section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/x7icLic6UZiaxCribaxOmicLlFicT7katUn2DAqNM6l4xgyYrzN7Nagm0Y650RpTF2DcEiawvNKTv5spJkTR9gpyQYUL4THLhYKTJywV0z5cicaoKvo/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>03</span></strong></p></section></section><section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span>研究兴趣浓厚，具备较强创新意识、学术潜力与专业能力；</span></p></section></section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/x7icLic6UZiaxDtJApI6MgSgvQ65XbN5GsmkabhYYfywUqcxeuibZVEpTX6RUqB5Z4quSg7TzBZgmKdDJYgCtKF5U7KRToPckG3aGr1ibaS18czs/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>04</span></strong></p></section></section><section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span>身心健康，符合国家及我校体检标准。</span></p></section></section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/x7icLic6UZiaxDBV7nWALycgIAaqhrylnLKGpicewjB546pRoZuo82lO01rHybfPJ6SNkmNq6WWAQBmriarGGTmMdkxJg4JU2z0rCUPEpkVy2lFQ/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><b><span>03</span></b></p></section></section><section><section><p><b><span>接收专业</span></b></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><p><span>我院接收推免生均为全日制，包含</span><span>计算机技术、通信工程、软件工程、人工智能</span><span>等四个专业。</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span><span>注：预报名系统内专业仅供参考，最终以学校发布的 2027 推免招生专业目录为准。</span></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><b><span>04</span></b></p></section></section><section><section><p><b><span>申请流程</span></b></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span>1、登录预报名系统填报志愿，按提示上传、提交全部申请材料。</span></p></section><section><section></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>填报时间：</span></strong></p><p><span><span>2026‑09‑03 08:00 — 2026‑09‑11 18:00</span></span></p><p><strong><span>系统网址：</span></strong></p><p><span><span>https://grd.ccnu.edu.cn/student/ytmlogin</span></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><p><span>2. 学院审核与复试。学院将完成材料审核，确定复试名单，预计 9 月中旬组织复试。复试具体时间、考核形式、地点由我院另行发布通知，请持续关注学院官网 / 公众号消息，保持通讯畅通。</span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><b><span>05</span></b></p></section></section><section><section><p><b><span>注意事项</span></b></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><ol><li><p><span>学校推免预报名系统仅作为前期志愿征集辅助工具。所有推免生的资格确认、报考、录取备案，必须在教育部全国推免服务系统完成，否则录取无效。</span></p></li><li><p><span>复试录取相关规则，请留意研究生院后续发布的《华中师范大学 2027 年接收优秀应届本科毕业生免试攻读全日制研究生办法》。</span></p><section></section><p><span><br/></span></p></li><li><p><span>请同学们仔细核对材料，按时完成预报名，逾期系统关闭不再受理。</span></p></li></ol><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span><span>更多信息请点击下方图片阅读华中师范大学研究生院发布的</span></span><span><span>《华中师范大学 2027 年接收优秀应届本科毕业生免试攻读研究生预报名通知》</span></span></p><p><a href=\"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MzkyNzgxNTM5Ng==&amp;mid=2247491017&amp;idx=1&amp;sn=e604d72a9919ff649be91069e6e79589&amp;scene=21#wechat_redirect\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/x7icLic6UZiaxBO6ibqBicMJibGic4dKaR7CoODETwQjlkxISJfeqctcLU8n0XBYE7hlOB4xW4uu31njACNlUrCf2P2MKD7dI0kuCiajg6bcJs8rTBY/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\"/></span></a></p><section><span><br/></span></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><p><b><span><span>咨询方式</span></span></b></p></section></section><section><section><sect